    "打开任一资产详情，点「退役」即可将不用的物品移到这里。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Open any asset's detail page and tap \"Retire\" to move items you no longer use here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打开资产详情页，点「退役」按钮，可记录退役日期与卖出价格。退役后的物品会出现在资产首页的「已退役」筛选中。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Open an asset's detail page and tap \"Retire\" to record the retire date and optional sale price. Retired items appear under the \"Retired\" filter on the Assets tab."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把想买的东西记在这里，理性消费，物有所值。" : {
